# History entries prior to 11.0

06-10-2021 I. Hrivnacova (test53-V10-07-07)
- Migration to new G4AnalysisManager.hh header;
  define the default output file type (root),
  do not call fAnalysisManager->Write(),CloseFile() twice.

4-08-2021 Ben Morgan (test53-V10-07-06)
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project

19-07-2021 Ivana Hrivnacova (test53-V10-07-05)
- Updated for changes in the analysis category:
  removed deleting of the analysis manager,
  as this is now done by the Geant4 kernel.

22-May-2021 Gabriele Cosmo (test53-V10-07-04)
- Run: added missing protection in EndOfRun() in case number of event is zero.
- RunAction: avoid deletion or PrimaryGeneratorAction in destructor for master,
  responsible for double-deletion.

17-May-2021 Jonathan Madsen (test53-V10-07-03)
- Removed G4AutoDelete of G4GlobalMagFieldMessenger
- Removed deleting fStepMaxProcess

05-05-2021 Ben Morgan (test53-V10-07-02)
- Do not install tests

18-02-21 Ben Morgan (test53-V10-07-01)
